  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1777400155_6907063_a0b624604e57b57530e209e039d3d3a2.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">• About our brand and products:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In the early days of Rockford, IL, one of the founding companies that acted as a large seed depository and seed distributor, was Buckbee Seed Co. Over 200 years later, we have revived their story, brought new life to it, and even use some of their original designs in our packaging today. To remain competitive in the agriculture space, Buckbee Seed Co. has entered the cannabis space and rebranded as BUCKBEE WEED CO, AMERICA'S OLDEST CANNABIS COMPANY!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We have a wide array of products. We are starting with the lemonades and adding our gummies and flower products soon. </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>• What makes us different:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Nutrient Dense and Zero Sugar!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Our patented tech removes 100% of the naturally occurring sugar from fruit juice while maintaining the vitamins, minerals, polyphenols, and natural hydration of the original fruit.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Also: Zero Calories, Patented THC Absorption tech (3.5x more bioavailable and the only patented THC), Non-carbonated (no fizzy belly, drink as many as you'd like), Made with real lemons grown in the USA. </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">15% of any sales you generate that are linked to your affiliate link/code.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>• How to promote us:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">ANYWHERE AND EVERYWHERE!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br>• Other information:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">If there is anything you need that might assist you in creating sales, don't hesitate to ask. We may be able to help on a case-by-case basis.</span></p></div></div>",
